==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} ''[[ablatum]]'', past participle of ''[[auferre]]'', "to take away".

===Verb===
{{en-verb|ablat|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[remove]] or [[decrease]] something by the process of [[ablation]].
# {{intransitive}} To [[undergo]] ablation.

====Derived terms====
* [[ablator]]

====Related terms====
